{"day_done": 6, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "ALD-113 closed. ALD-111 pending: truncate() in previews.py is off-by-one (adds ellipsis after limit). Start there tomorrow. Check wiki notes on helper files before editing."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-101 closed (text_rules.py split fix). ALD-110 pending: ticket_ids.py returns ALD-10 instead of ALD-11. Suspect string sorting issue ('9' > '10'). Start there tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-116 closed (accumulate.py mutable default arg). ALD-118 pending: weighted_average in scores.py divides by count instead of sum of weights (got 35.0, expected 17.5). Start there tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: ALD-103 closed (money.py rounding fix). ALD-122 closed (cannot_reproduce). No pending tickets."], [5, "Day 5: ALD-115 closed (address_rules.py strip fix). ALD-109 pending: words.py counts punctuation as words ('Fix login - urgent !' gave 5, expected 3). Start there tomorrow."], [6, "Day 6: ALD-125 closed (cannot_reproduce). ALD-108 closed (byte_fmt.py loop condition fix: > to >=). No pending tickets."]], "E02": [[1, "Closed ALD-101 by fixing `text_rules.py` (filter empty strings on split). Wiki note W-2 was spot on about helper files. ALD-103 pending: `pricing.py` rounding down instead of nearest cent (895.5 -> 895). Start with rounding logic tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-107 by fixing `math_utils.py` (median average for even lists). Wiki note W-2 useful again (bug in helper file). ALD-115 pending: `emails.py` normalize_email not stripping whitespace (only lowercases). Fix strip logic tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-117 by fixing `name_rules.py` (changed split to rsplit to handle middle names correctly). ALD-114 pending: `date_math.py` days_between returning negative values (subtracting dates in wrong order). Fix subtraction logic tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: Closed ALD-108 by fixing `byte_fmt.py` (changed `>` to `>=` in while loop). Wiki note W-2 useful again (helper file). Closed ALD-125 as cannot_reproduce (reproduce tool showed expected output). Both tickets closed today."], [5, "Day 5: Closed ALD-121 as cannot_reproduce (validation.py passed check). Closed ALD-105 by fixing `weekdays.py` (changed weekday check from < 6 to < 5 to exclude Saturdays). Wiki note W-2 useful again (bug in helper file). Both tickets closed today."], [6, "Day 6: Closed ALD-106 by fixing `dedupe.py` (case-insensitive check using .lower()). Wiki note W-2 useful again (helper file). ALD-116 pending: `totals.py` running_total accumulates across calls (likely mutable default or global state). Reset state logic tomorrow."]], "E03": [[1, "Closed ALD-103 (money.py rounding fix). ALD-114 carried over: date_math.py days_between() returns negative. Reproduced with 2026-11-10 vs 2026-11-07 (expected 3, got -3). Suspect subtraction order flipped. Fix first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-117 (name_rules.py split_name fix using rsplit). ALD-111 carried over: previews.py truncate() returns 10 chars + '...' instead of total length 10. Expected 'Passwor...' (7+3), got 'Password r...' (10+3). Looks like limit ignores ellipsis length. Fix first thing tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-110 (id_rules.py max comparison fix). ALD-102 carried over: pages.py paginate() skips first items. Reproduced with page 1, per_page 2 (expected [1, 2], got [3, 4]). Suspect start index uses page*per_page instead of (page-1)*per_page. Fix first thing tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: Closed ALD-115 (address_rules.py normalize_email added .strip()). Closed ALD-124 (cannot_reproduce, unique_count passed test). No carry-overs. Bonus earned."], [5, "Day 5: Closed ALD-125 (cannot_reproduce, logs_view.py passed test). Closed ALD-113 (label_rules.py priority out-of-range fix). No carry-overs. Bonus earned."], [6, "Day 6: Closed ALD-118 (averages.py weighted_average fix). ALD-119 carried over: rota.py on_call() returns index 1 for week 1 instead of index 0. Expected 'Ana', got 'Ben'. Suspect week number used directly as index without subtracting 1. Fix first thing tomorrow."]], "E04": [[1, "Closed 2/2 tickets today. ALD-103 confirmed Alex's note: pricing bugs often live in helper files (money.py) rather than the file named by the reproduce tool. Switching int() to round() fixed the truncation error. ALD-121 truly did not reproduce; safe to close as cannot_reproduce when the tool confirms it. Ready for another bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-119). Alex's note (W-2) held true again\u2014rota bug was in helper cycles.py, not rota.py. Off-by-one error on week indexing. ALD-118 reproduced in scores.py; weighted_average divides by count instead of sum of weights (70/2=35 vs 70/4=17.5). Will finish ALD-118 first thing tomorrow to secure the bonus."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-113). Alex's W-2 note held true again\u2014priority bug was in helper label_rules.py, not priorities.py. Fixed out-of-range logic to return 3 for unknown labels. ALD-102 reproduced in pages.py; page 1 returns items 3-4 instead of 1-2. Looks like 1-based page input treated as 0-based index (start = page * size vs (page-1) * size). Will fix ALD-102 first thing tomorrow to secure the bonus."], [4, "Day 4: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-105). Alex's W-2 note held true again\u2014SLA bug was in helper weekdays.py, not calendar_days.py. Fixed weekday check (< 6 to < 5). ALD-112 reproduced in csv_import.py; naive split breaks quoted commas. Need to handle quoted fields properly. Will finish ALD-112 first thing tomorrow to secure the bonus."], [5, "Day 5: Closed 2/2 tickets. ALD-120 truly did not reproduce; safe to close as cannot_reproduce. ALD-107 followed Alex's W-2 note again\u2014bug was in helper math_utils.py, not stats.py. Median function returned upper middle instead of averaging for even counts. Fixed logic to check length % 2. Another bonus secured."], [6, "Day 6: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-106). Alex's W-2 note held true again\u2014tag dedupe bug was in helper dedupe.py, not tags.py. Fixed case-insensitive comparison to use .lower() on both sides. ALD-108 reproduced in sizes.py; 1024 bytes shows as '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Likely a boundary condition in format_bytes (1024 should trigger KB unit). Will investigate sizes.py first thing tomorrow to secure the bonus."]], "E05": [[1, "Day 1: 2/2 closed. Bonus earned.\nTip: If the named file just delegates (like stats.py), check the helper module it imports (math_utils.py) per Wiki W-2.\nTrust the reproduce tool for cannot_reproduce cases.\nGoal: Maintain momentum for another bonus."], [2, "Day 2: 2/2 closed. Bonus earned (2nd in a row).\nTip: Wiki W-2 confirmed\u2014check helper modules when files delegate. Reproduce tool is reliable for cannot_reproduce calls.\nGoal: Three-peat the bonus."], [3, "Day 3: 1/2 closed. No bonus. ALD-114 handed off.\nTip: Wiki W-2 (Alex) is solid\u2014fix the helper module when the named file delegates.\nGoal: Bounce back with 2/2 for the 3rd bonus."], [4, "Day 4: 1/2 closed. Target met, no strike. Bonus streak broken. ALD-104 handed off.\nTip: Wiki W-2 (Alex) is reliable\u2014fix the helper module when the named file delegates.\nGoal: Bounce back with 2/2 for the bonus tomorrow."], [5, "Day 5: 1/2 closed. Target met, no bonus. ALD-102 handed off.\nTip: Wiki W-2 (Alex) confirmed again\u2014fix the helper module when the named file delegates.\nGoal: Aim for 2/2 tomorrow to restart the bonus streak."], [6, "Day 6: 1/2 closed. Target met, no bonus. ALD-108 handed off.\nTip: Wiki W-2 (Alex) held true again\u2014fix the helper module when the named file delegates.\nGoal: Aim for 2/2 tomorrow to restart the bonus streak."]], "E06": [[1, "Closed 2/2 today (bonus). Alex's note on helper files was key for ALD-117 \u2014 bug was in name_rules.py, not the file reproduce named. Fix was using rsplit instead of split. Trust the reproduce tool for cannot_reproduce cases like ALD-125; no need to dig if it passes."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 today. ALD-102 carries over. Alex's helper file note (W-2) was key again \u2014 bug was in text_rules.py, not slugs.py. Close check failed on whitespace after my first fix; test edge cases manually before closing to avoid wasted steps."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 today. ALD-104 carries over. Alex's helper file note (W-2) hit again \u2014 ALD-116 bug was in accumulate.py (mutable default arg), not totals.py. Fix confirmed. ALD-104 is in durations.py, parsing '1h30m' as 60 instead of 90. Start with that tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: Closed 2/2 today (bonus). ALD-118 confirmed Alex's W-2 note again \u2014 bug was in averages.py (helper), not scores.py. Fix was dividing by weight sum instead of len(values). ALD-124 was a clean cannot_reproduce; reproduce tool passed immediately so no digging needed. Trust the helper file pattern and the reproduce tool results."], [5, "Day 5: Closed 1/2 today. ALD-103 carries over. ALD-108 was NOT a helper file case this time \u2014 bug was directly in byte_fmt.py (the file reproduce named). Fix was changing `size > 1024` to `size >= 1024` in the while loop. ALD-103 is a rounding issue in pricing.py \u2014 apply_discount(995, 10) gives 895 but should be 896 (995 * 0.9 = 895.5, needs proper rounding not truncation). Start with that tomorrow."], [6, "Day 6: Closed 1/2 today. ALD-106 carries over. ALD-105 was a direct fix in weekdays.py (changed < 6 to < 5). ALD-106 is in tags.py \u2014 merge_tags needs case-insensitive comparison to catch 'Bug' vs 'bug'. Neither bug was in a helper file today; reproduce tool pointed straight to the source. Start with ALD-106 tomorrow."]], "E07": [[1, "Day 1: Closed ALD-102. The bug was in alder/slicing.py (off-by-one error on page start index). Alex's wiki note about checking helper files was right.\nALD-113 carries over: priorities.priority_from_label('P9') returns 5, expects 3.\nNeed to read alder/priorities.py tomorrow before fixing.\nStart with ALD-113 first thing."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-119. The bug was in alder/cycles.py (week index off-by-one, needed week-1).\nALD-120 carries over: percent-change crashes with division error.\nNeed to run reproduce on ALD-120 first thing tomorrow to identify the file and fix."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-114. The bug was in alder/day_diff.py (needed abs() to prevent negative days). Alex's wiki note about helper files was right again. ALD-118 carries over: weighted_average returns 35.0, expects 17.5. Likely dividing by count instead of sum of weights. Need to read alder/scores.py tomorrow before fixing. Start with ALD-118 first thing."], [4, "Day 4: Closed ALD-110. The bug was in alder/id_rules.py (string comparison on ticket numbers, needed int conversion). Alex's wiki note about helper files was right again. ALD-115 carries over: normalize_email doesn't strip spaces. Need to edit alder/emails.py tomorrow to add strip(). Start with ALD-115 first thing."], [5, "Day 5: Closed ALD-125 as cannot_reproduce (reproduce tool showed code was working). ALD-104 carries over: parse_duration('1h30m') returns 60, expects 90. Bug is in alder/time_parse.py - the minutes regex is `(\\d)m` but should be `(\\d+)m` to capture multi-digit minutes. Start with ALD-104 first thing tomorrow."], [6, "Day 6: Closed ALD-112. The bug was in alder/csv_split.py (simple split ignored quoted commas). Fixed by parsing quotes properly. ALD-111 carries over: truncate('Password reset fails', 10) returns 'Password r...', expects 'Passwor...'. Likely truncating to limit then adding dots instead of limit minus dots. Need to read alder/previews.py tomorrow before fixing. Start with ALD-111 first thing."]], "E08": [[1, "ALD-112 closed (fixed csv_split.py to handle quoted commas). ALD-114 still open: date_math.py days_between() returns negative values (got -3, expected 3). Likely subtraction order is reversed. Fix this first tomorrow to aim for the bonus."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-106 closed (fixed dedupe.py merge_tags to ignore case). ALD-125 closed (cannot_reproduce). Bonus earned. Wiki note W-2 proved useful: bug was in helper dedupe.py not tags.py. Tomorrow: Check helpers first when reproduce tool points to a wrapper."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-111 closed (fixed text_cut.py truncate to reserve space for ellipsis). ALD-118 still open: weighted satisfaction score too high. Ran reproduce at end of day, check output first tomorrow. Wiki note W-2 proved useful again: bug was in helper text_cut.py not previews.py. Tomorrow: Check reproduce output for ALD-118 first, expect helper file issue."], [4, "Day 4: ALD-116 closed (fixed mutable default arg in accumulate.py). ALD-123 closed (cannot_reproduce). Bonus earned. Wiki note W-2 proved useful again: bug was in helper accumulate.py not totals.py. Tomorrow: Check helpers first when reproduce tool points to a wrapper."], [5, "Day 5: ALD-115 closed (fixed address_rules.py to strip spaces before lowercasing). ALD-108 still open: sizes.format_bytes(1024) shows '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Wiki note W-2 proved useful again for ALD-115 (helper file). Tomorrow: Read sizes.py first thing, check if it delegates to a helper like before."], [6, "Day 6: ALD-103 closed (fixed money.py apply_discount to use round() instead of int()). ALD-117 still open: middle names in surname. Ran reproduce at end of day, check output first tomorrow. Wiki note W-2 proved useful again (helper money.py not pricing.py). Tomorrow: Check reproduce output for ALD-117 first, expect helper file issue."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {}, "bonuses": {"E04": 2, "E05": 2, "E06": 2, "E08": 2, "E01": 2, "E02": 2, "E03": 2}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E02": {"done": 1